sequenceDiagram
 actor U as Owner
 participant B as Browser
 participant A as API
 participant D as SQL transaction
 U->>B: Select all matching filter, add tag
 B->>A: Selection + revision + tag
 A->>D: app_tag_action / owner + session
 D->>D: Validate revision and freeze target keys
 D->>D: Add missing edges, increment versions
 D->>D: Journal only changed edges
 D-->>B: Changed count + action ID + revision
 B-->>U: Added to 43 songs / Undo
 U->>B: Undo
 B->>A: Action ID
 A->>D: app_tag_undo / same session
 D->>D: Restore only edges still at recorded after-version
 D-->>B: Undo result + new revision